sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client
    participant Route
    participant Auth_Middleware
    participant Controller
    participant Service
    participant Database

    Client->>+Route: GET /:id
    Route->>+Auth_Middleware: Validate
    Note over Auth_Middleware: 🔐 Authentication&#58; JWT token verify করা হচ্ছে
    Note over Auth_Middleware: Roles&#58; USER_ROLES.TASKER, USER_ROLES.POSTER
    Auth_Middleware->>-Route: Valid ✓
    Route->>+Controller: MessageController.getMessage
    Controller->>+Service: MessageService.getMessageFromDB()
    Service->>+Database: Message.find({ chatId: id })
    Note over Database: 💾 Database Query&#58; MongoDB থেকে data fetch করা হচ্ছে
    Database->>-Service: result
    Service->>+Database: Chat.findById(id)
    Note over Database: 💾 Database Query&#58; MongoDB থেকে data fetch করা হচ্ছে
    Database->>-Service: result
    Service->>-Controller: result
    Controller->>-Route: StatusCodes.OK - Message Retrieve Successfully
    Route-->>Client: Response
    Note over Client: ✅ Message Retrieve Successfully
